362 root and 18 workflow public functions. Root wrapper names begin
with etpy_ and workflow wrapper names begin with etpy_workflow_.

Loading eyetrajectories does not initialize Python; using a wrapper does.
An installed PyPI distribution may differ from this source snapshot.
Run etpy_verify_api(strict = TRUE) to detect differences in public
function availability. Optional Python dependencies and all scientific
limitations remain inherited from the Python backend. R parity of names
does not qualify any estimator's uncertainty coverage or validity.
